---

<BaseLayout
  title="单船票页面原型 · 船客"
  description="单船票页面原型，用于讨论筛选、船司、舱位与余舱信息呈现。"
  path="/prototype/single-tickets"
>
  <article class="ticket-prototype">
    <section class="proto-hero">
      <div class="proto-copy">
        <p class="proto-label">PROTOTYPE · 单船票信息架构</p>
        <h1>按船司、档期、天数和政策找单船票</h1>
        <p>
          这是基于“单船票小程序展现形式”文档做的原型。正式页面不应只列自制方案，
          而应把船司库存、特殊政策、舱位和余舱状态作为核心入口。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="proto-summary" aria-label="原型摘要">
        <strong>9</strong>
        <span>重点船司</span>
        <strong>7</strong>
        <span>筛选维度</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="partner-stage" aria-label="紧密合作邮轮公司">
      <div class="stage-heading">
        <p>重点合作邮轮公司</p>
        <h2>先让客人按熟悉的船司品牌进入</h2>
        <span>排序按你给的业务优先级：庞洛、银海、夸克、66度、A21、SWAN、OW、信天翁、欧若拉。</span>
      </div>
      <div class="partner-logo-grid">
        {
          cruisePartners.map((partner, index) => (
            <article class="partner-logo-card">
              <span class="partner-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
              <div class="partner-logo-box">
                {partner.logo ? (
                  <img src={partner.logo} alt={partner.fullName} loading="lazy" />
                ) : (
                  <strong>{partner.name}</strong>
                )}
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3>{partner.name}</h3>
                <p>{partner.fullName}</p>
                <small>{partner.routeHint}</small>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="top-route-stage" aria-label="银海精选航线">
      <div class="top-route-copy">
        <p>银海邮轮 · TOP 5 待填</p>
        <h2>后续把最受欢迎的 5 条银海航线放在这里</h2>
        <span>你给我真实航线后，我会把这些占位替换成可点开的航线卡：目的地、天数、船名、政策、起价或询价状态。</span>
      </div>
      <ol class="top-route-list">
        {silverseaTopPlaceholders.map((item) => <li>{item}<span>等待船票同事确认</span></li>)}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <nav class="variant-switch" aria-label="原型方案切换">
      <a href="?v=filter" data-variant-link="filter">筛选货架</a>
      <a href="?v=company" data-variant-link="company">船司优先</a>
      <a href="?v=matrix" data-variant-link="matrix">档期矩阵</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="variant-panel" data-variant="filter">
      <div class="find-cruise-panel">
        <div class="find-heading">
          <p>FIND A CRUISE</p>
          <h2>像船司官网一样先帮客人缩小范围</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="filter-grid" data-filter-scope>
          <label>
            <span>目的地 / 航线</span>
            <select data-filter="destination">
              {destinations.map((item) => <option value={item}>{item}</option>)}
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>出发时间</span>
            <select data-filter="month">
              {months.map((item) => <option value={item}>{item}</option>)}
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>航程天数</span>
            <select data-filter="days">
              {days.map((item) => <option value={item}>{item}</option>)}
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>邮轮公司 / 船名</span>
            <select data-filter="company">
              {companies.map((item) => <option value={item}>{item}</option>)}
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>特殊政策</span>
            <select data-filter="policy">
              {policies.map((item) => <option value={item}>{item}</option>)}
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>航次编号 / 关键词</span>
            <input data-filter="keyword" type="search" placeholder="银海、南极、海神号" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="quick-row">
          <button type="button" data-reset>清空筛选</button>
          <span><strong data-count>{cruises.length}</strong> 个示例航次</span>
          <label class="toggle-line">
            <input type="checkbox" checked data-available-only />
            <span>仅看可咨询航次</span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ticket-results" data-results>
        {
          cruises.map((item) => (
            <article
              class="ticket-card"
              data-company={item.company}
              data-month={item.month}
              data-days={item.days}
              data-destination={item.destination}
              data-policy={item.policy.join(" ")}
              data-keyword={`${item.title} ${item.ship} ${item.company} ${item.destination}`}
            >
              <div class="ticket-logo">
                <img src={item.logo} alt={item.company} loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="ticket-main">
                <p>{item.company} · {item.ship}</p>
                <h3>{item.title}</h3>
                <div class="ticket-meta">
                  <span>{item.destination}</span>
                  <span>{item.month}</span>
                  <span>{item.days}</span>
                </div>
                <p class="ticket-note">{item.note}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ticket-side">
                <span class="inventory">{item.inventory}</span>
                <strong>{item.price}</strong>
                <small>{item.cabins}</small>
                <div class="policy-row">
                  {item.policy.map((policy) => <span>{policy}</span>)}
                </div>
                <a href="/advisor/">询价</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="variant-panel" data-variant="company" hidden>
      <div class="company-layout">
        <aside class="company-rail">
          <h2>按船司进入</h2>
          <p>适合船票同事维护库存：每个船司下面挂航次、舱位、政策和船书。</p>
          {companies.filter((item) => item !== "全部").map((item) => <button type="button">{item}</button>)}
        </aside>
        <div class="company-feed">
          {
            companies
              .filter((item) => item !== "全部")
              .map((company) => {
                const list = cruises.filter((cruise) => cruise.company === company);
                return (
                  <section class="company-section">
                    <div>
                      <h3>{company}</h3>
                      <span>{list.length} 个示例航次</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="compact-list">
                      {list.map((item) => (
                        <a href="/advisor/">
                          <strong>{item.title}</strong>
                          <span>{item.month} · {item.days} · {item.inventory}</span>
                        </a>
                      ))}
                    </div>
                  </section>
                );
              })
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="variant-panel" data-variant="matrix" hidden>
      <div class="matrix-intro">
        <h2>档期矩阵</h2>
        <p>如果单船票库存量未来很多，可以用月份 × 船司的方式快速扫货，再进入详情询价。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ticket-matrix">
        <div class="matrix-head">船司 / 月份</div>
        {months.filter((item) => item !== "全部").map((item) => <div class="matrix-head">{item}</div>)}
        {
          companies
            .filter((item) => item !== "全部")
            .map((company) => (
              <>
                <div class="matrix-company">{company}</div>
                {months.filter((item) => item !== "全部").map((month) => {
                  const count = cruises.filter((item) => item.company === company && item.month === month).length;
                  return <div class:list={["matrix-cell", { active: count > 0 }]}>{count > 0 ? `${count} 个` : "—"}</div>;
                })}
              </>
            ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // @ts-nocheck
  const panels = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("[data-variant]"));
  const links = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("[data-variant-link]"));
  const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  const initialVariant = params.get("v") || "filter";

  function showVariant(name) {
    panels.forEach((panel) => {
      panel.hidden = panel.getAttribute("data-variant") !== name;
    });
    links.forEach((link) => {
      link.classList.toggle("on", link.getAttribute("data-variant-link") === name);
    });
  }
  showVariant(initialVariant);

  const filters = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("[data-filter]"));
  const cards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".ticket-card"));
  const count = document.querySelector("[data-count]");
  const reset = document.querySelector("[data-reset]");

  function pass(card, key, value) {
    if (!value || value === "全部") return true;
    return (card.getAttribute(`data-${key}`) || "").toLowerCase().includes(value.toLowerCase());
  }

  function applyFilters() {
    const values = Object.fromEntries(filters.map((item) => [item.getAttribute("data-filter"), item.value.trim()]));
    let visible = 0;
    cards.forEach((card) => {
      const ok =
        pass(card, "destination", values.destination) &&
        pass(card, "month", values.month) &&
        pass(card, "days", values.days) &&
        pass(card, "company", values.company) &&
        pass(card, "policy", values.policy) &&
        pass(card, "keyword", values.keyword);
      card.hidden = !ok;
      if (ok) visible += 1;
    });
    if (count) count.textContent = String(visible);
  }

  filters.forEach((item) => item.addEventListener("input", applyFilters));
  reset?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    filters.forEach((item) => {
      item.value = item.tagName === "SELECT" ? "全部" : "";
    });
    applyFilters();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .ticket-prototype {
    background: #f5f5f7;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    padding-bottom: 96px;
  }
  .proto-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 220px;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: end;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 72px var(--page-pad) 36px;
  }
  .proto-label {
    color: #0066cc;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .proto-copy h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 12px 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 76px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .proto-copy p:last-child {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #6e6e73;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .proto-summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8px 14px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5ea;
    border-radius: 22px;
  }
  .proto-summary strong {
    font-size: 44px;
    color: #003b71;
  }
  .proto-summary span {
    align-self: center;
    color: #6e6e73;
  }
  .partner-stage,
  .top-route-stage {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    padding: 0 var(--page-pad);
  }
  .stage-heading,
  .top-route-stage {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .stage-heading {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .stage-heading p,
  .top-route-copy p {
    color: #0066cc;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .stage-heading h2,
  .top-route-copy h2 {
    max-width: 780px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 54px);
    line-height: 1.08;
  }
  .stage-heading span,
  .top-route-copy span {
    max-width: 840px;
    color: #6e6e73;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .partner-logo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .partner-logo-card {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 96px auto;
    gap: 18px;
    min-height: 260px;
    padding: 22px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5ea;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }
  .partner-index {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: 18px;
    color: #b8b8bd;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .partner-logo-box {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 16px 44px 16px 16px;
    background: #f5f5f7;
    border-radius: 18px;
  }
  .partner-logo-box img {
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 58px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .partner-logo-box strong {
    color: #003b71;
    font-size: 28px;
  }
  .partner-logo-card h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #003b71;
  }
  .partner-logo-card p {
    margin: 6px 0 10px;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }
  .partner-logo-card small {
    color: #6e6e73;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .top-route-stage {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(320px, 1.1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding-top: 8px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .top-route-copy,
  .top-route-list {
    padding: 28px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5ea;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }
  .top-route-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: route;
  }
  .top-route-list li {
    counter-increment: route;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 15px 16px;
    background: #f5f5f7;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .top-route-list li::before {
    content: counter(route);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    color: #fff;
    background: #003b71;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .top-route-list span {
    color: #86868b;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .variant-switch {
    position: sticky;
    top: 72px;
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    padding: 10px var(--page-pad);
    background: rgba(245, 245, 247, 0.86);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  }
  .variant-switch a {
    padding: 10px 18px;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid #d2d2d7;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .variant-switch a.on {
    color: #fff;
    background: #003b71;
    border-color: #003b71;
